+- worker_runtime `check_active`, `_check_optional_sources`, `_read_lease`, capture/plan/supervision completion, route and publish_grounding; task/verification/current-age checks move together in the local branch.
+- bootstrap definition/start/_derive/_proposal_usable/bootstrap_contract/compile_bootstrap_original_plan/_promote: registration, claim/update/capture ordering, TTL and task/verification/lease deadlines. Codec replay uses recorded typed D causality, never current wall time or live reconstruction.
+- supervision definition/_apply/current_supervision_publication/validate_initial_supervision/derive_supervision: lease/deadline, periodic cursor, original captured-frame TTL and claim/history ordering. Periods remain original; late reply cost stays recorded.
+- owner_registration original construction/freeze/effective_deadline/bind_step_grounding; visual_owner strict_checkpoint, validate_group/publication/current_publication/initial_inputs/validate_grounding and retry/verification pools; visual_verification `_execution_grounding`, `_computed_route`, derive_route and effect-completion lineage. Do not leave these UTC gates in a route labelled fully local D.
+- both real event repositories' initialize/transition bootstrap and supervision, initialize/publish owner and verification routing, generic checkpoint/budget/recovery CAS paths that can touch an operational task. Unknown caller/legacy writer cannot mutate an operational record via a generic method. They either join the genuine private local transaction scope or reject; terminal cancellation can revoke safely.
+- route_verification and local VerificationBudgetState construction/decoding: preserve counters, smaller policies, no-progress and original hard budget. Do not call start() again to refresh a stored original.
+- execution startup elapsed calculation, check_active, caller/model return timeout budgets, PRE_SAFETY/PRE_SKILL and worker_dispatch_guard are B/C handoff targets; C cannot claim local source/time closure while these still decide on UTC or fresh monotonic origins.
+
+The B stage plan must lock exact new schema tags/field sets for bootstrap definition/record/transition/promotion, supervision definition/record/transition, original/grounding/publication, verification route-input/route/effect-completion and budget references. Existing v1/v2 schemas keep their exact bytes and UTC semantics. Genuine external contract valid_until, remote images/certificates/third-party leases and the original1000ms future/5000ms age rules stay strict UTC; unbridged mixed sources remain UNKNOWN. A local application-owned contract must be provenance-typed at its actual producer; merely labelling an external deadline local is forbidden. Diagnostic timestamp values need not pretend monotonic ordering under UTC jumps; recorded D event order supplies local causality.
+
+Publication reads after BOTH actual locks are acquired. Cross two SQLite DBs without claiming a distributed atomic commit: hold job guard/txn while event commit records its exact job generation and operation. If both DBs must change, use durable pending/completion phases with fail-closed reconciliation. Dispatch requires complete matching committed records; missing second commit is not permission. Snapshot validation before lock is insufficient. No repository lock is held across network/model/physical actions.
+
+### C: sole executor, backend and recorder; sixteen nodes
+
+`vision/operational_execution.py` is the narrowly proposed action-context/segment bridge, not another executor. It binds actual worker/app owner, lease session, original observation/window/source, compiled payload, action/step/attempt, backend/episode and permitted collection/native scope. A later plan binds exact signatures and pins after B.
+
+Cover both actual executor entry branches, and the real handler **after** parameter/precondition evaluation. One-use handler admission is followed by short current gates at joint queue/target mutation, immediate gripper `_gripper_open`/ctrl mutation, delayed dequeue/start, and every `_apply_control + one mj_step` in all three loops. Queue items retain their original source/action/fence/windows; ACK is not start. Initial source/native/TTL obligations are rechecked at true submit/start consumption; continuation does not invent repeated native revalidation of an old frame at every step, but always checks original hard task/lease and registered action/horizon. Preserve partial performed steps/ctrl if a native call returns late; stop further mutation and success. No claim of interruption of a blocked native call or deterministic future-wall completion.
+
+Internal e-stop/hold/queue clearing remains reachable even without authority, but does not accept a public bypass permitting new targets. Observer remains read-only audit, not admission veto. Hook exceptions retain ledger/missing denominator; the explicit guard controls motion. Keep one executor, one backend and one operation observer. RawRecorder binds the segment sink into its existing observer/purpose/execute_attempt, allocating before reads/work and closing in finally. Sidecar has `(segment_id,parent_id,kind,step,owner,D_BEGIN,D_END,S_BEGIN,S_END,app_reference,lease_reference,disposition,missing_reason)` and joins every allocated operation/frame/action/raw SHA. Existing raw bytes/schema are untouched; missing/partial entries are retained.
+
+ExperimentClock's new mode uses original D_app event/current differences and preserves fractional WAIT remainder; it never restarts task budget or converts simulated steps into wall timeout. Request/WAIT/render/controller complete segment denominators are tested. PCSC0.5/1/2/5 seconds stays independent.
+
+TEACHER_COLLECTION comes only from the actual application/worker factory consuming a validated registered recipe and establishing fresh job/attempt/source/owner scope. A string, mode boolean, exported descriptor or public constructor cannot grant it. It preserves source/current D, safety/Shield, pixel/proprio grounding, sole execution and accounting, records `TEACHER_COLLECTION_NOT_NATIVE_QUALIFIED`, and never manufactures a native VALID/finite q. The later P7 producer supplies this real registration; C can use explicitly CPU-typed test registration to prove the mechanism, not calibration qualification. Its source/time acceptance is the input to P7 actual prerequisites, avoiding the D dependency cycle. Exact eight-skill recipe, full S horizon, LIFT>=50mm/.5S, RELEASE>=1S, complete rigid points and nine-component denominator remain R91/P7 obligations.
+
+### D: two retained native final positives
+
+After P7/P8's genuine producer/checker inputs, source qualification, schemas and three consumer integration are independently accepted, activate exactly the Memory and SQLite `test_full_runtime_positive_with_registered_native_support` nodes. Each must actually traverse startup -> publication -> grounding -> PRE_SAFETY -> PRE_SKILL -> sole handler -> ACK -> actual start -> complete registered effect with real native checker and Shield, no constant VALID/mock permission. ROOT binds those future input SHAs in that stage's actual Astra plan. Their absence today is a deferred dependency, not a reason to block A/B/C or erase the final requirement. Software closure, actual collection/normal-chain outcomes and formal acceptance remain distinct.
